      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشْبِلٌ</span></b>  A lioness <i>whose whelps,</i> or <i>young ones,
accompany her,</i> (S, O, Msb,) <i>going with her.</i>
(S, O.) And A she-camel <i>whose young one has
become strong, and goes with her.</i> (AZ, S, O.)
